name: sim.setExplicitHandling
description: Sets the explicit handling flags for a scene object
luaSynopsis: sim.setExplicitHandling(int objectHandle, int explicitFlags)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setExplicitHandling(int objectHandle, int explicitFlags)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of a scene object.
2. explicitFlags: explicit handling flags. For now only bit 0 is used
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: explicitHandling, class: proximitySensor, file: proximitySensor_explicitHandling.property
- name: explicitHandling, class: visionSensor, file: visionSensor_explicitHandling.property
